# 24x7 remote-fleet scratch. Evidence text lives in receipts/ and quality/; this
# tree is host-local fleet state (lane run dumps, eval shards, native scratch,
# one-off PowerShell probes) and is durable on the remote box, not in git.
# NOTE: files already committed under this path before 2026-10-08 are still
# tracked — .gitignore only stops re-adding. Untracking is a separate, explicit
# `git rm -r --cached .dsh-24x7` performed during history reconciliation so the
# deletions land in one reviewable commit. See docs/ULTRA_PROD_READINESS.md (P2).
.dsh-24x7/**
# mutmut work tree (scores are written by scripts/mutation_score.py)
mutants/
# PROOFCORE artifacts (DESIGN.md §13): proof bundles + provenance duckdb are
# host-local evidence — proof-run orchestration is pending.
proofs/
leakage-report.json

# Local editor / agent tool state — never evidence, never part of a review.
.cursor/
.serena/
.freebuff/
.box-soft-verify/
.playwright-mcp/
.hypothesis/

# Stray nested trees created by the off-machine sftp clobber (root cause in
# tools/guard-config.ps1): the Mac-side `put -r src /D:/dipcatcher/src`
# re-creates src/src & tests/tests, and a scripts/scripts tree was committed
# the same way. Ignore the nested trees so a routine `git add .`/`git add -A`
# can never re-track them.
/src/src/
/tests/tests/
/scripts/scripts/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# L8 hygiene (2026-10-08) — cache scratch + TRACKED-FILE CARVE-OUTS.
# Invariant: an ignore rule must never hide tracked evidence or inputs. Two
# documented exceptions appear in `git ls-files -i -c --exclude-standard` and
# both are pending the single history-reconciliation untracking commit
# (AGENTS.md caveat / docs/ULTRA_PROD_READINESS.md P2 — not piecemeal):
# (1) .dsh-24x7 fleet scratch (~911 files, block above), and
# (2) editor/agent tool state (.cursor/ .serena/ .freebuff/ .box-soft-verify/).
# Everything else tracked is carved out below. KEEP THIS BLOCK LAST.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# pytest-benchmark scratch (durable scores go under reports/).
.benchmarks/
# git-worktree scratch — also in .git/info/exclude; keep the rule portable so
# fresh clones behave identically.
.worktrees/
# Derived qpanel caches — regenerate via the research pipeline. Two dirs hold
# tracked evidence panels (byte-pinned in .gitattributes): carve them out below.
research/*/qpanel_cache/
!research/chop_robustness_20261007b/qpanel_cache/
!research/chop_robustness_20261007b/qpanel_cache/**
!research/chop_robustness_benchconfig_20261007/qpanel_cache/
!research/chop_robustness_benchconfig_20261007/qpanel_cache/**
